{"id": 8955772698822, "title": "Momcozy Waterdrop Breast Milk Collection Shell", "body_html": "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>Discreet All-Day Leak Collection:</strong></p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Slim waterdrop-shaped design sits comfortably inside your nursing bra, helping collect natural milk leakage throughout the day. Perfect for work, travel, and everyday wear without adding bulk.</p>\n<p><strong>Petal-Soft Comfort Fit:</strong></p>\n<p>Designed to follow the natural shape of your breast, the ultra-soft silicone edge provides a gentle, barely-there feel, while the wide opening offers comfortable daily wear.</p>\n<p><strong>Secure, Spill-Free Pouring:</strong></p>\n<p>A supportive dual-material design combines soft silicone comfort with a structured outer shell for stability. The built-in pour spout allows easy milk transfer with less mess.</p>\n<p><strong>2-in-1 Nursing Pad Alternative:</strong></p>\n<p>More than a milk collector, it also helps replace disposable nursing pads by discreetly capturing light leaks while keeping you comfortable and confident throughout the day.</p>\n<p><strong>Easy to Clean &amp; Store:</strong></p>\n<p>The detachable design makes cleaning quick and simple. Comes with a protective storage case to keep your collection shells clean, organized, and ready to use.</p>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Accessories", "created_at": "2026-07-09T23:31:18-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-breast-milk-collection-shell", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:18-04:00", "published_at": "2026-07-10T04:58:07-04:00", "template_suffix": "bp-bc004", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "Breastfeeding supplies, 储奶收集, 吸奶器, 吸奶器小品, 小品主链", "variants": [{"id": 46051151282374, "product_id": 8955772698822, "title": "2 Count", "price": "20.39", "sku": "BC004-PK71205N1011-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "29.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "2 Count", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2026-